# Frozen 2026-11-11 (README timelines 53 and 54). Lowered from
# 5000/10000/20000/40000 the same evening, before any matrix data, because
# check.sh (logs/redis-check_20261111-192414.txt) showed both wide cells
# missing 40000: perf wide reached 22926 req/s and eBPF wide 31225, with
# redis at 1.00 core. redis runs commands on one thread (plan R1), and wide
# tracing roughly doubles its CPU per request, so traced capacity falls far
# below the untraced plateau (about 53900 req/s, pilot_report.txt).
# Doubling ladder, 8x span, the same shape as nginx's and fio's. 20000 is the
# highest doubling top below perf wide's limit (about 87 % of it, a thin
# margin), and every rate is a multiple of 2500 (memtier's 20 ms refill).
# Changing any line means a new results directory: schema.json records it.
LADDER="1:2500 2:5000 3:10000 4:20000"
MEMTIER_THREADS=2
MEMTIER_CLIENTS=25
